x items-center justify-center tap-highlight-transparent outline-solid outline-transparent data-[focus-visible=true]:z-10 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-2 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-focus data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-offset-2 w-[42px] h-[42px] rounded-[16.8px] bg-ds-bg-off shadow-[0px_2.52px_12.6px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)]\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"sr-only\">open navigation menu</span><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 7h14M4 11h14M4 15h14\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></ul></header></nav><main class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 items-center min-w-36\"><section class=\"w-full bg-ds-bg-warm\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1120px] px-5 md:px-10 py-12 md:py-16\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mb-4\"><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"/\">Payam</a><span class=\"mx-1.5\">/</span><span class=\"text-black/70\">For organisasjoner</span></nav><h1 class=\"text-[30px] md:text-[44px] font-semibold tracking-[-1px] leading-tight max-w-[820px]\">Payam for <span class=\"text-ds-brand-emerald\">bedrifter og universiteter</span></h1><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[16px] md:text-[18px] mt-4 max-w-[760px]\">Gi de ansatte eller studentene deres BIMM Premium. Ta kontakt, så setter vi opp tilgang for e-postdomenet deres — så verifiserer folkene deres jobb- eller universitets-e-posten i appen for å låse opp deals på restauranter og kafeer i Oslo.</p><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"mailto:support@bimm.app?subject=BIMM%20for%20teamet%20v%C3%A5rt\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black text-white px-7 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-medium hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\">Ta kontakt</a><a href=\"mailto:support@bimm.app?subject=BIMM%20for%20teamet%20v%C3%A5rt\" class=\"text-[15px] text-black/60 hover:text-black underline\">support@payam.ng</a></div><section class=\"mt-14\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Slik fungerer det</h2><ol class=\"mt-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><span class=\"text-ds-brand-emerald font-semibold text-[15px]\">Steg 1</span><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px] mt-1\">Ta kontakt</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-2\">Send oss en e-post på support@bimm.app og fortell om teamet eller campusen deres og omtrent hvor mange det gjelder.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><span class=\"text-ds-brand-emerald font-semibold text-[15px]\">Steg 2</span><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px] mt-1\">Vi godkjenner e-postdomenet deres</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-2\">Vi legger organisasjonens e-postdomene (for eksempel bedriften.no eller universitetet.no) til BIMMs tilgangsliste.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><span class=\"text-ds-brand-emerald font-semibold text-[15px]\">Steg 3</span><h3 class=\"text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px] mt-1\">De ansatte låser opp Premium</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-2\">Alle med en jobb- eller universitets-e-post på det domenet verifiserer den i BIMM-appen, og Premium låses opp uten kostnad for dem. Tilgangen fornyes jevnlig.</p></li></ol></section><section class=\"mt-14\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Hvem det passer for</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[18px] md:text-[20px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">For bedrifter</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-2\">Et gode teamet faktisk bruker — det blir rimeligere å spise ute rundt kontoret, hele året. Et enkelt og meningsfullt personalgode som er lett å rulle ut, uten kort eller koder.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[18px] md:text-[20px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\">For universiteter og høyskoler</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-2\">Gi studentene et reelt gode i en dyr studiehverdag: medlemspriser på mat og kaffe i hele byen, låst opp med universitets-e-posten de allerede har.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-14\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Dette får folkene deres med Premium</h2><ul class=\"mt-6 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] text-black/75 leading-snug\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-ds-brand-emerald font-semibold mt-0.5\">✓</span><span>2-for-1-retter, faste kronerabatter og gratisvarer på restauranter og kafeer</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] text-black/75 leading-snug\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-ds-brand-emerald font-semibold mt-0.5\">✓</span><span>Gratis stempelkort — trenger ikke abonnement for å samle stempler</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] text-black/75 leading-snug\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-ds-brand-emerald font-semibold mt-0.5\">✓</span><span>Nye deals legges til jevnlig, først og fremst i Oslo og noen få andre byer</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] text-black/75 leading-snug\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-ds-brand-emerald font-semibold mt-0.5\">✓</span><span>Book en deal, møt opp og sveip for å sjekke inn — ingen kuponger, ingen koder</span></li></ul></section><section class=\"mt-14\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">BIMM-deals akkurat nå</h2><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[15px] mt-2 max-w-[760px]\">Et live øyeblikksbilde av hva teamet deres ville fått tilgang til i Oslo i dag.</p><div class=\"mt-6\"><section aria-label=\"Deal-statistikk\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">Pay</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Aktive deals</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">Shop</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Steder med deals</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">20–478 kr</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Besparelse per besøk</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">≈ 109 kr</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Snittbesparelse</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">Order</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">2 for 1-deals</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">Buy</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Faste rabatter</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">Explore</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Gratis produkter</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">Follow</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Stempelkort</p></div></div><p class=\"text-black/70 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] leading-relaxed mt-5 max-w-[820px]\">Per oktober 2026 har BIMM 100 aktive deals hos 48 spisesteder i Oslo, med besparelser fra 20 til 478 kroner per besøk (i snitt rundt 109 kroner), pluss 103 gratis stempelkort.</p><p class=\"text-black/40 text-[13px] mt-2\">Oppdatert oktober 2026 · basert på live data fra BIMM-appen</p></section></div></section><section class=\"mt-14 rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-ds-bg-off p-6 md:p-8\"><h2 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Ta BIMM med til organisasjonen deres</h2><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[15px] mt-2 max-w-[700px]\">Fortell oss hvem dere er og omtrent hvor mange det gjelder, så setter vi sammen en plan som passer. Helt uforpliktende å ta praten.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"mailto:support@bimm.app?subject=BIMM%20for%20teamet%20v%C3%A5rt\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black text-white px-7 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-medium hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\">Ta kontakt</a><a href=\"mailto:support@bimm.app?subject=BIMM%20for%20teamet%20v%C3%A5rt\" class=\"text-[16px] font-medium text-black hover:opacity-70 underline\">support@payam.ng</a></div></section><section aria-label=\"Ofte stilte spørsmål\" class=\"mt-14 pt-8 border-t border-black/10\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] mb-5\">Ofte stilte spørsmål</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-[820px]\"><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Hvordan gir vi teamet eller studentene våre BIMM Premium?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Ta kontakt på support@bimm.app. Vi legger organisasjonens e-postdomene til BIMMs tilgangsliste; deretter verifiserer alle med en jobb- eller universitets-e-post på det domenet den i appen, og Premium låses opp uten kostnad for dem. Tilgangen fornyes jevnlig.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Hva koster det for organisasjonen?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Det kommer an på størrelse og oppsett, så det finnes ingen fast pris å oppgi her — send oss en e-post på support@bimm.app, så setter vi sammen en plan som passer teamet eller campusen deres.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Er det gratis for de ansatte eller studentene?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Ja — når e-postdomenet deres er godkjent, låses Premium opp uten kostnad for dem. De verifiserer rett og slett jobb- eller universitets-e-posten sin i BIMM-appen.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Hva får de med Premium?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Alle BIMM-deals — 2-for-1-retter, faste kronerabatter og gratisvarer på restauranter og kafeer, først og fremst i Oslo — pluss gratis stempelkort. De booker en deal i appen, møter opp og sjekker inn; ingen kuponger eller koder.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Hvordan kommer vi i gang?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Send en e-post til support@bimm.app med organisasjonen deres og omtrent hvor mange det gjelder, så tar vi det derfra.</p></details></div></section></div></section><div class=\"w-full bg-ds-bg-warm py-10 lg:py-16\"><div class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1520px] px-5 md:px-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[14px] lg:hidden\"><div class=\"relative rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden h-[620px]\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/reference/d972bdbf2cb31d3d.webp\"/><div class=\"relative z-[5] flex flex-col items-center gap-[20px] w-full pt-[23px]\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 w-[140px] h-[48px]\"><img alt=\"Payam\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"989\" height=\"293\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/payam/logo.png\"/></div><div class=\"flex 